      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "5884f727117c363a6acb842be55743bdd5239c86033421a9053c38c26f3e49fb:000000_-3162782448438629691:g0:r12",
      "row_index_0based": 12,
      "serialized_row_index": 12,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "早く早く、とぐいぐい背中を押される。\nあまりに押され過ぎて、勢い余って転びそうだった。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "f08f1848ec5a92e3f77c9f4f29d111a8c9fcf27d5de243e8f7b84c4c8743dd28",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "太陽の光を浴びて、仲間が石になっちまってるんだ！\n心配だろ！？　早く元に戻してやんねぇとだろ！？",
      "jp_sha256": "e51b95d572c602497ba42f4e8927d428fe64a8cc674dc5ebdedf772658398658",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "햇빛을 받아 동료가 돌이 돼 버렸어!\n걱정되지!? 빨리 원래대로 돌려놔야 하잖아!?",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 14,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b004-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "5884f727117c363a6acb842be55743bdd5239c86033421a9053c38c26f3e49fb:000000_-3162782448438629691:g0:r13",
      "row_index_0based": 13,
      "serialized_row_index": 13,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ベルティオ",
        "Emt10_Sad",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "太陽の光を浴びて、仲間が石になっちまってるんだ！\n心配だろ！？　早く元に戻してやんねぇとだろ！？",
